  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive). Pattern: X⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧ Y⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{尋|たず}ねる (ask X about Y).\n\nASPECT: て⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates ongoing or completed action. {尋|たず}ねて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ = 'is asking.'\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{道|みち}→道：00505_michi⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{尋|たず}ねる (ask for directions)\n- ⟦{名前|なまえ}→名前：02234_namae⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{尋|たず}ねる (ask someone's name)\n- ⟦{意見|いけん}→意見：01303_iken⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{尋|たず}ねる (ask for an opinion)\n\nHOMOPHONE: Don't confuse with ⟦{訪|たず}ねる→訪ねる：01182_tazuneru⟧ (to visit), which has the same reading but different kanji and meaning.\n- {尋|たず}ねる (尋): to ask, inquire\n- ⟦{訪|たず}ねる→訪ねる：01182_tazuneru⟧ (訪): to visit\n\nCONTRAST WITH ⟦{聞|き}く→聞く：00483_kiku⟧:\n- ⟦{聞|き}く→聞く：00483_kiku⟧: general 'ask' or 'listen' (neutral)\n- {尋|たず}ねる: 'inquire' (slightly more formal)\n\nREGISTER: Slightly formal. ⟦{聞|き}く→聞く：00483_kiku⟧ is more casual.",
